 oject (the team behind AI 2027). Unlike AI 2027\, it's a recommendation ra
 ther than a prediction: an international deal in which the US and China ag
 ree in 2029 to avoid a race to superintelligence\, all AI research becomes
  publicly transparent\, capabilities scale slowly through the human range\
